{"id":"6909e67a0a112410","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-symplectic-manifold.md","title":"Symplectic Manifold","display":"df-symplectic-manifold — Symplectic Manifold","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-symplectic-manifold","aliases":["58-df-symplectic-manifold","Symplectic Manifold"],"display":"df-symplectic-manifold — Symplectic Manifold","depends_on":["[[58-df-symplectic-form]]","[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-symplectic-manifold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-symplectic-manifold</span><span>Symplectic Manifold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-symplectic-manifold — Symplectic Manifold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"297834c6f058cefe\" href=\"?note=297834c6f058cefe\" title=\"58-df-symplectic-form\">58-df-symplectic-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (smooth manifold)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\in\\Omega^2(M)\">\\(\\omega\\in\\Omega^2(M)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\)</span> (smooth-manifold predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SymplecticForm}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SymplecticForm}_S\\)</span> (closed nondegenerate two-form predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"297834c6f058cefe\" href=\"?note=297834c6f058cefe\" title=\"58-df-symplectic-form\">58-df-symplectic-form</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SymplecticManifold}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SymplecticManifold}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\operatorname{SymplecticManifold}_S(M,\\omega)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\land\\operatorname{SymplecticForm}_S(\\omega,M)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\operatorname{SymplecticManifold}_S(M,\\omega)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\land\\operatorname{SymplecticForm}_S(\\omega,M)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nondegeneracy forces the dimension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> to be even; no free dimension parameter is needed in the predicate.</li>\n<li>The smooth-manifold call uses the upstream two-place signature with the dimension as its second argument.</li>\n<li>Darboux's local normal form is a theorem, not a defining clause.</li>\n<li>The symplectomorphism group is a separate construction from the definition of a symplectic manifold.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>McDuff and Salamon, Introduction to Symplectic Topology</li>\n<li>Cannas da Silva, Lectures on Symplectic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-symplectic-form","status":"resolved","id":"297834c6f058cefe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-symplectic-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)$ (smooth-manifold predicate, see [[58-df-smooth-manifold]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-symplectic-form","status":"resolved","id":"297834c6f058cefe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SymplecticForm}_S$ (closed nondegenerate two-form predicate, see [[58-df-symplectic-form]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\in\\Omega^2(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SymplecticForm}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SymplecticManifold}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}manifold} \\vdash \\operatorname{SymplecticManifold}_S(M,\\omega)\\leftrightarrow\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{SmoothManifold}_S(M,n)\\land\\operatorname{SymplecticForm}_S(\\omega,M)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1462,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1279","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-symplectic-manifold.md|58-df-symplectic-manifold]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["297834c6f058cefe","71fe0dc4c8613e69"]}